  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gina Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T14:20:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T14:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. My name is Gina Iannuccilli. I'm a landlord, I've got a place at 25 Kingston Avenue, up Historic Hill. I'm getting a dumpster for a job and I don't understand the rules. It'd sit on the street, and that's a no-parking zone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T14:20:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a dumpster on the street. Generally that takes a permit from the city. Is it going in the no-parking stretch, or just near it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T14:21:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In it, I think. Wait, no, next to it. I'm not sure what's the difference. Does it matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T14:21:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can. I'd have someone look at the exact spot. Do you have a contractor doing the work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T14:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do. Does he have to be the one who applies? Does it need a licensed contractor, or can I do it, as the owner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T14:21:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me get you the right person for that. I'll note the address and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T14:21:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hold on, not you, the speaker. This thing in my kitchen keeps answering stuff I never asked it. Wicked annoying. Sorry, where were we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-02T14:21:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'll transfer you to the inspector who handles street permits, Mrs. Iannuccilli."
    }
  ],
